{"chunk_id": "gold_ops_ambiguous_service_reference", "content": "Ambiguous pod or service references should not be resolved from memory alone. Retrieval may return clarification-oriented context when a query says this pod, this service, or yesterday without enough concrete namespace or service identity.", "content_hash": "a218c044ea911b3f6125d75cf100cf82f9ac8995e37eca3f3171120ab125f2e6", "doc_id": "docs/rag-operational-runbook.md", "id": "gold_ops_ambiguous_service_reference", "metadata": {"manual_confirmation": "confirmed from local runbook clarification coverage", "source_lines": "101-118", "source_path": "docs/rag-operational-runbook.md"}, "source_type": "ops_case", "updated_at": "2026-08-18T00:00:00Z"}
